    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.9a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 1.9a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf héo forð ne cume, fo se cyng to ðam were ⁊ beo se ðeof utlah wið eal folc.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he fails, the king shall take the wergeld, and the thief shall be treated as an outlaw by all the nation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif heo forð ne cume, fo se cyning to þam were, ⁊ beo se þeof utlah wið eall folc.</ab>
      </div>
